OL,3,AHurricane Polo intensifies into rare
OL,4,Acategory 5 storm off the coast of
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Polo has rapidly intensified
OL,8,Foff the coast of Mexico to become one
OL,9,Fof the most powerful storms of the
OL,10,Fseason in the Pacific Ocean.
OL,12,FA Hurricane Hunter aircraft, operated
OL,13,Fby the US National Oceanic and
OL,14,FAtmospheric Administration (Noaa), flew
OL,15,Finto the storm on Tuesday and recorded
OL,16,Fsustained wind speeds near 180 mph (285
OL,17,Fkm/h), with stronger gusts.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
