OL,3,AHurricane Polo intensifies into rare
OL,4,Acategory 5 storm off the coast of
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe storm is projected to head toward
OL,8,Fthe coast of south-western Mexico, but
OL,9,Fis not expected to make landfall,
OL,10,Faccording to Noaa's Miami-based
OL,11,FNational Hurricane Center.
OL,13,FThe agency called Polo "extremely
OL,14,Fdangerous" and said its intensification
OL,15,Fover 24 hours was "truly remarkable".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
